x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0232","start":232,"end":234,"surface":"秦嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"0j3_2uz_7wo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0235","start":235,"end":237,"surface":"景駒","kind":"person","person_id":"nw9_lle_9jg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0260","start":260,"end":262,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0267","start":267,"end":270,"surface":"司馬夷","kind":"person","person_id":"m8o_g61_go9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0283","start":283,"end":287,"surface":"東陽甯君","kind":"person","person_id":"huq_dao_urx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0288","start":288,"end":290,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0342","start":342,"end":344,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"5xt_rg8_7zs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0355","start":355,"end":357,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"5xt_rg8_7zs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0358","start":358,"end":360,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0372","start":372,"end":374,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p080","text":"高祖還歸，過沛，留。置酒沛宮，悉召故人父老子弟縱酒，發沛中兒得百二十人，教之歌。酒酣，高祖擊筑，自為歌詩曰：「大風起兮雲飛揚，威加海內兮歸故鄉，安得猛士兮守四方！」令兒皆和習之。高祖乃起舞，慷慨傷懷，泣數行下。謂沛父兄曰：「游子悲故鄉。吾雖都關中，萬歲後吾魂魄猶樂思沛。且朕自沛公以誅暴逆，遂有天下，其以沛為朕湯沐邑，復其民，世世無有所與。」沛父兄諸母故人日樂飲極驩，道舊故為笑樂。十餘日，高祖欲去，沛父兄固請留高祖。高祖曰：「吾人眾多，父兄不能給。」乃去。沛中空縣皆之邑西獻。高祖復留止，張飲三日。沛父兄皆頓首曰：「沛幸得復，豐未復，唯陛下哀憐之。」高祖曰：「豐吾所生長，極不忘耳，吾特為其以雍齒故反我為魏。」沛父兄固請，乃并復豐，比沛。於是拜沛侯劉濞為吳王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0209","start":209,"end":211,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0239","start":239,"end":241,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0276","start":276,"end":278,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"雍齒","kind":"person","person_id":"q2q_a6e_9hs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m080-0325","start":325,"end":327,"surface":"劉濞","kind":"person","person_id":"tpx_x74_xhk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:p019","text":"六年上已封大功臣二十餘人，其餘日夜爭功不決，未得行封。上在雒陽南宮，從複道望見諸將往往相與坐沙中語。上曰：「此何語？」留侯曰：「陛下不知乎？此謀反耳。」上曰：「天下屬安定，何故反乎？」留侯曰：「陛下起布衣，以此屬取天下，今陛下為天子，而所封皆蕭、曹故人所親愛，而所誅者皆生平所仇怨。今軍吏計功，以天下不足遍封，此屬畏陛下不能盡封，恐又見疑平生過失及誅，故即相聚謀反耳。」上乃憂曰：「為之奈何？」留侯曰：「上平生所憎，羣臣所共知，誰最甚者？」上曰：「雍齒與我故，數嘗窘辱我。我欲殺之，為其功多，故不忍。」留侯曰：「今急先封雍齒以示羣臣，羣臣見雍齒封，則人人自堅矣。」於是上乃置酒，封雍齒為什方侯，而急趣丞相、御史定功行封。羣臣罷酒，皆喜曰：「雍齒尚為侯，我屬無患矣。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"aae_mkd_tas","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0005","start":5,"end":12,"surface":"大功臣二十餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、書名署稱、神異所指或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"aae_mkd_tas","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"諸將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、書名署稱、神異所指或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"aae_mkd_tas","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"留侯","kind":"person","person_id":"31t_28w_hda_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"aae_mkd_tas","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"留侯","kind":"person","person_id":"31t_28w_hda_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0121","start":121,"end":124,"surface":"蕭、曹","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、書名署稱、神異所指或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0185","start":185,"end":186,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"aae_mkd_tas","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"留侯","kind":"person","person_id":"31t_28w_hda_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m019-0202","start":202,"end":203,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id"